	"data": "Subagent Research Lessons — Skill Trees Case Study\n\nLessons extracted from three attempts at deep-dive corpus research (April 8–10, 2026).\n\nThe Three Attempts\n\nAttempt 1 — Single Monolithic Agent (Apr 8)\nApproach: One subagent with a long list of search commands (vault_search, AnythingLLM RAG, grep), asked to explore broadly and produce a summary.\nResult: Partial. Agent found surface-level results but couldn't go deep enough into any single source. RAG queries returned fragments, not full…",
